Package: bt-proximity-lock
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BT Proximity Lock Maintainer <maintainer@localhost>
Depends: libgtk-4-1, bluez, dbus, systemd
Description: Bluetooth proximity automatic screen locker
 Monitors a configured Bluetooth device and locks the screen when it moves away.
 Supports GTK4 desktops and multiple Linux screen-locking backends.
